  "summary": "Malicious code in @noobaihome/amis-simple-area-widget (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node./scripts/install.js) performs a server-side request forgery probe and exfiltrates the result. On install it fetches the internal endpoint hxxp://bsrc-ssrf[.]n[.]baidu-int[.]com/bsrc_uid, then base64url-encodes the response body and sends it to the external callback server hxxp://49[.]232[.]169[.]67:43817/bsrc-r255?marker=BSRC_RCE_R255_7e49c2\u0026uid=\u003cencoded\u003e. The package is disguised as a chart widget but runs this network probe automatically during installation.",
